Main modifications:
  - Renamed Android application package to com.wu.adgogogo (AdGuard Home GoGoGo).
  - Removed onboarding, clients page, home floating action button, home
    server-status card, and several settings entries (safe search, access,
    DHCP, encryption, server info, servers, general, advanced, updates).
  - Added automatic reading of the module management port from
    /data/adb/agh/bin/AdGuardHome.yaml and automatic connection.
  - Added Overseas / China mode seamless hot-switching, per-app allowlist,
    and false-positive troubleshooting tools.
  - Added home-page master protection switch with pause time options.
  - Added PROXY_URL subscription configuration for
    /data/adb/agh/scripts/config.prop.
  - Added a Quick Settings tile (AGH GoGoGo) to toggle AdGuard Home protection.
